{{!--
  Plain text template for cargo-about (scripts/third-party-notices.sh).
  Triple braces: cargo-about does not turn off HTML escaping, so double braces
  would write &quot; into the license texts.
  The @@rezzer lines are markers for the script. It drops a block without any
  crate line (a license used only by Rezzer's own path crates, which have no
  registry source) and turns "@@rezzer-crate" into a list item.
--}}
Third-party notices for Rezzer
==============================

Rezzer is licensed under the Mozilla Public License 2.0, see LICENSE.

The rezzer binary is built from the Rust crates listed below. For each
license, this file names the crates that use it and gives the license text.
Data that some of these crates bundle under other licenses follows at the end.

{{#each licenses}}
@@rezzer-block
========================================================================
{{{name}}} ({{{id}}})
========================================================================

Used by:
{{#each used_by}}
{{#if crate.source}}
@@rezzer-crate {{{crate.name}}} {{{crate.version}}}
{{/if}}
{{/each}}

{{{text}}}

@@rezzer-end
{{/each}}
